        <h3>No More Slipping</h3>
        <p>Implant attachment dramatically reduces the movement and embarrassment that comes with conventional dentures.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card fade-up">
        <h3>Eat More Comfortably</h3>
        <p>Chewing force increases substantially when teeth are anchored to bone. Many patients find meals more comfortable and more enjoyable.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card fade-up">
        <h3>Bone Preservation</h3>
        <p>The implants that support the denture stimulate the jawbone, slowing the bone loss that follows tooth removal.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card fade-up">
        <h3>Reduced Adhesive Use</h3>
        <p>When your denture snaps onto implants, messy adhesives become unnecessary.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
